# Subagent-driven-development scratch: ledgers, briefs, review packages.
.superpowers/

# Personal Claude Code overrides. `.claude/settings.json` is tracked and shared;
# this one is not, and the directory being tracked makes it committable by accident.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Legacy import working directories (DEPLOYMENT.md section 7a). They hold the
# exported JSONL, which names 444 real proposers and their email addresses,
# and the converted images. This repo is public and mirrors to GitLab, so a
# stray `git add` here would publish student and sponsor PII.
#
# Matched by pattern, not by name. This was a list of two directories until
# 2026-09-18, when a top-up import wrote its output to `new-out/` and landed
# outside it: every cohort gets its own directory, so naming them one by one
# means the list is wrong whenever someone adds a cohort. Anything ending
# `-out/` is treated as import output. `.output` is covered separately above.
*-out/
